  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">S&#xf8;rfond 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of S&#xf8;rfond is to strengthening Freedom of Expression and Human Rights in undeveloped countries. Further, the grant shall contribute to strenhtening film as a cultural expression, to promote artistic integrity and diversity. This includes support to productions and producers that will contribute to promote women&#x2019;s rights and gender equality. The grant shall also contribute to an increased cooperation between Norwegian filmmakers and filmmakers in developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
